\title{gbscan: Scan GenBank for Genetic Markers}
\description{
Counts and downloads nucleotide records for genetic markers and taxa from GenBank (NCBI). Downloads run in batches, can resume after an interruption, and can hold more than 50,000 records for one taxon and marker. The parsers write record and feature metadata to two tibbles, add taxonomic ranks from the NCBI Taxonomy database, and write the sequences of each marker to FASTA files. A marker dictionary is supplied with the package. The user can edit it to add or change markers.
